ore Communication Networks' activity occurs with the activation condition that 'Communication Status' is 'Down', then a 'Restore Communication Networks' activity must eventually occur after that event with the correlation condition that 'Communication Status' is 'Operational' at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Restore Communication Networks' events with 'Communication Status' as 'Down' can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Restore Communication Networks' event with 'Communication Status' as 'Operational' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding events. If 'Restore Communication Networks' with 'Communication Status' as 'Down' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Restore Communication Networks' with 'Communication Status' as 'Operational'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Restore Communication Networks\",\"description\":\"The 'Restore Communication Networks' activity entails repairing and re-establishing communication infrastructure to ensure connectivity in affected areas.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Restore Communication Networks\",\"description\":\"The 'Restore Communication Networks' activity entails repairing and re-establishing communication infrastructure to ensure connectivity in affected areas.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Communication Status is Down\",\"correlation_condition\":\"T.Communication Status is Operational\",\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Monitor Seismic Activity' activity occurs with the activation condition that 'Magnitude' is greater than 7, then an 'Issue Tsunami Alert' activity must eventually occur after that 'Monitor Seismic Activity' event at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Monitor Seismic Activity' events with 'Magnitude' grea